{"count":1095,"next":"https://api.afp.mil.ph/articles/?page=3&page_size=100","previous":"https://api.afp.mil.ph/articles/?page_size=100","results":[{"id":1302,"title":"AFP joins 128th Philippine Independence Day Commemoration","slug":"afp-joins-128th-philippine-independence-day-commemoration","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"","featured_image":"/media/articles/AFP_joins_128th_Philippine_Independence_Day_Commemoration.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-06-12T15:33:51.401316+08:00","hits":1208},{"id":1,"title":"2024 International Canoe Federation Dragon Boat World Championship opens in Puerto Princesa","slug":"2024-international-canoe-federation-dragon-boat-world-championship-opens-in-puerto-princesa","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The 2024 International Canoe Federation (ICF) Dragon Boat World Championship officially opened today, October 31, in Puerto Princesa City, Palawan, with General Romeo S. Brawner Jr., Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (CSAFP), representing President Ferdinand Marcos Jr.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/CAN.jpg","image_caption":"General Romeo S. Brawner Jr., Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines, and local government and sporting officials during the mudball throwing ceremony at the kickoff of the 2024 International Canoe Federation Dragon Boat World Championship on October 31, in Puerto Princesa City, Palawan.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-10-31T10:54:08+08:00","hits":543},{"id":2,"title":"FOI in Visayas Command","slug":"foi-in-visayas-command","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) through the Public Affairs Office, AFP (PAOAFP) recently conducted a Cascading Activity on the Freedom of Information (FOI) Program at the Visayas Command (VISCOM). The event aimed to enhance transparency, accountability, and public trust within the organization.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/FOI1.jpg","image_caption":"LtGen Fernando M Reyeg and Col Xerxes A Trinidad in a discussion during the PAOAFP's visit to VISCOM for the AFP FOI Program cascading activity.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-10-30T10:52:29+08:00","hits":507},{"id":3,"title":"CSAFP Welcomes New Turkish Military Attaché in Courtesy Visit","slug":"csafp-welcomes-new-turkish-military-attache-in-courtesy-visit","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City –General Romeo S. Brawner Jr., Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines, welcomed Captain Gokhan Gulbiten, the new Military Attaché of Turkey to the Philippines in a courtesy visit held today, here.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/TUR.jpg","image_caption":"General Romeo S Brawner Jr, AFP Chief of Staff welcomes Captain Gokhan Gulbiten, Military Attaché of Turkey to the Philippines during his courtesy visit on October 29.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-10-29T10:50:40+08:00","hits":548},{"id":4,"title":"AFP Welcomes French Strike Force Commander for Strategic Maritime Cooperation","slug":"afp-welcomes-french-strike-force-commander-for-strategic-maritime-cooperation","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City–The Armed Forces of the Philippines welcomed RAdm Jacques Mallard, Commander of the French Strike Force (COMFRSTSRKFOR) in a courtesy visit on October 28, 2024, here. The visit was hosted by Major General Arvin R Lagamon, AFP Deputy Chief of Staff for Civil-Military Operations, J7, on behalf of General Romeo S Brawner Jr, AFP Chief of Staff.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/FRE.jpg","image_caption":"MGen Arvin R Lagamon, AFP Deputy Chief of Staff for Civil-Military Operations, J7, and RAdm Jacques Mallard, Commander of the French Strike Force gather for a photo with senior AFP and FRSTSRKFOR officers during their meeting on October 28.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-10-29T10:49:11+08:00","hits":2140},{"id":5,"title":"CSAFP Commends 9th Infantry Division for Excellence in HADR and Internal Security Operations","slug":"csafp-commends-9th-infantry-division-for-excellence-in-hadr-and-internal-security-operations","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—General Romeo S Brawner Jr., Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines, expressed his pride in the 9th Infantry Division for their exemplary service in balancing Humanitarian Assistance and Disaster Response (HADR) operations alongside ongoing Internal Security Operations during his visit on October 28, 2024, at Camp Elias Angeles, San Jose, Pili, Camarines Sur.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/COM.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr awards the Wounded Personnel Medal to Corporal Jaypee J Garido PA, during his visit at Camp Elias Angeles, San Jose, Pili, Camarines Sur, on October 28.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-10-28T13:51:51+08:00","hits":598},{"id":6,"title":"CSAFP Leads Aerial Survey and Relief Efforts in Kristine-Affected Areas","slug":"csafp-leads-aerial-survey-and-relief-efforts-in-kristine-affected-areas","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—General Romeo S Brawner Jr, Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines, conducted an aerial survey over the severely impacted areas of Naga City, Milaor, and Bula, held today, assessing the extensive damage caused by Typhoon Kristine.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/LEADS.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr leads the distribution of relief items to residents of Barangay Duran in Balatan, Camarines Sur, on October 28.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-10-28T13:47:26+08:00","hits":411},{"id":7,"title":"SINGAPORE AND MALAYSIA AIR ASSETS ARRIVE IN CJVAB TO SUPPORT HADR EFFORTS ","slug":"singapore-and-malaysia-air-assets-arrive-in-cjvab-to-support-hadr-efforts","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Armed Forces of the Philippines through the Philippine Air Force (PAF) received a significant boost in its ongoing Humanitarian Assistance and Disaster Response (HADR) operations with the arrival of foreign air assets on October 26, 2024.<br /><br /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">A C-130 cargo aircraft from the Republic of Singapore Air Force (RSAF) and a Eurocopter EC725 transport helicopter from the Royal Malaysian Air Force (RMAF) landed at Col Jesus Villamor Air Base in Pasay City. These aircraft will be instrumental in supporting relief efforts in areas affected by Severe Tropical Storm Kristine.<br /><br /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The collaboration underscores the strong defense relationship between the Philippines, Singapore, and Malaysia, highlighting a collective commitment to disaster resilience and showcasing our readiness to work alongside allies in times of need.</div>\r\n</div>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/fca.jpg","image_caption":"Sec. Teodoro, Singapore and Malaysian Ambassadors, CG, PAF, LtGen Parreño, other PAF General Officers, representatives from OCD and Republic of Singapore Air Force personnel pose for a photo.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-10-27T13:43:56+08:00","hits":397},{"id":8,"title":"AFP Mobilizes Nationwide Response as Tropical Storm Kristine Continues Onslaught","slug":"afp-mobilizes-nationwide-response-as-tropical-storm-kristine-continues-onslaught","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) has ramped up its nationwide humanitarian assistance and disaster response (HADR) efforts as Tropical Storm “Kristine” continues to batter various parts of the country. Army, Air Force, and joint military units are on high alert, providing rescue and relief operations to affected communities.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/hadr2.jpg","image_caption":"⁨9th Infantry “Spear” Division (9ID) troopers distribute aid to flooding victims in Naga City on October 24, 2024.⁩","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-10-24T13:41:15+08:00","hits":420},{"id":9,"title":"AFP Welcomes Commander of ROK Naval Logistics Command","slug":"afp-welcomes-commander-of-rok-naval-logistics-command","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—Lieutenant General Arthur Cordura, Vice Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (VCSAFP), welcomed Rear Admiral Sangmin An, Commander of the Republic of Korea Navy (ROKN) Naval Logistics Command, during a courtesy call held on October 23, 2024, at the AFP General Headquarters here.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/rok.jpg","image_caption":"Lieutenant General Arthur Cordura, Vice Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (VCSAFP), welcomes Rear Admiral Sangmin An, Commander of the Republic of Korea Navy (ROKN) Naval Logistics Command, during a courtesy call held on October 23, 2024, at the AFP General Headquarters in Camp Aguinaldo.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-10-24T13:39:29+08:00","hits":1971},{"id":10,"title":"AFP STATEMENT | On AFP's Response to TS Kristine ","slug":"afp-statement-on-afps-response-to-ts-kristine","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p> Statement of General Romeo S Brawner Jr, Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines, regarding the AFP's humanitarian assistance and disaster response efforts amid challenges posed by Tropical Storm Kristine.</p>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/statk.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-10-23T13:32:59+08:00","hits":181},{"id":11,"title":"VCSAFP welcomes US INDOPACOM Deputy Commander","slug":"vcsafp-welcomes-us-indopacom-deputy-commander","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City— The Vice Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (VCSAFP), Lieutenant General Arthur Cordura, welcomed Lieutenant General Joshua M. Rudd, Deputy Commander of the United States Indo-Pacific Command (US INDOPACOM), to the AFP General Headquarters during the latter’s courtesy call on October 23 here.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/VCINDO.jpg","image_caption":"The Vice Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines Lieutenant General Arthur Cordura talks with Lieutenant General Joshua M. Rudd, Deputy Commander of the United States Indo-Pacific Command during their meeting at the AFP General Headquarters in Camp Aguinaldo, Quezon City on October 23.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-10-23T13:30:34+08:00","hits":200},{"id":12,"title":"CSAFP Receives Deputy Commander of US INDOPACOM at AFP General Headquarters","slug":"csafp-receives-deputy-commander-of-us-indopacom-at-afp-general-headquarters","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—General Romeo S. Brawner Jr., Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (CSAFP), welcomed Lieutenant General Joshua Rudd, Deputy Commander of the United States Indo-Pacific Command (US INDOPACOM), during his courtesy call on October 22, 2024, at the AFP General Headquarters. The meeting further solidified defense relations and cooperation between the Philippines and the United States, focusing on regional security and joint initiatives.<br /><br /></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">(Photo by SSg Ambay/ PAOAFP)</div>\r\n</div>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/INDO.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-10-22T13:26:01+08:00","hits":173},{"id":13,"title":"AFP Launches Mental Health Wellness Program","slug":"afp-launches-mental-health-wellness-program","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) launched its Mental Health Wellness Program on October 21, here with AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo Brawner Jr. as the Guest of Honor and Speaker. The program is a key initiative aimed at promoting mental health awareness, resilience, and holistic well-being among AFP personnel.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/TRO.jpg","image_caption":"Reserve Major Jose Sixto Dantes III speaks during the plenary on mental wellbeing during the launching of the AFP Mental Health Program on October 21 in Camp Aguinaldo, Quezon City.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-10-22T13:24:27+08:00","hits":394},{"id":14,"title":"AFP Honors LtGen Gaerlan in a Change of Chief of Office and Retirement Ceremony","slug":"afp-honors-ltgen-gaerlan-in-a-change-of-chief-of-office-and-retirement-ceremony","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City— The Armed Forces of the Philippines held a Change of Chief of Office and Retirement Ceremony, honoring Lt. General Charlton Sean M Gaerlan as he stepped down from his post as The AFP Deputy Chief of Staff (TDCSAFP), held on October 16, here.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/GAE1.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr awards the Chief of Staff AFP Commendation Medal to LtGen Charlton Sean M Gaerlan, outgoing TDCSAFP during the Change of Chief of Office and Retirement Ceremony on October 16.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-10-17T09:36:02+08:00","hits":850},{"id":15,"title":"AFP Renders Honor to VADM Adaci in an Exit Call","slug":"afp-renders-honor-to-vadm-adaci-in-an-exit-call","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City— The Armed Forces of the Philippines rendered arrival honors to Vice Admiral Toribio Adaci Jr., the Flag Officer in Command of the Philippine Navy, during his exit call to the AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr. on October 16, 2024, here.<br /><br /></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Vice Admiral Adaci is a member of the Philippine Military Academy “Makatao” Class of 1989. Prior his current stint, he commanded the Naval Forces Western Mindanao, the Naval Installation Command, and the Fleet-Marine Ready Force.<br /><br /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">The visit occurred ahead of Vice Admiral Adaci’s upcoming retirement in November, marking 39 years of distinguished career and invaluable service.<br /><br /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Photo by SSg Ambay/PAOAFP</div>\r\n</div>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/ADA1.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-10-16T09:33:07+08:00","hits":2204},{"id":16,"title":"CSAFP Joins Asia-Pacific Ministerial Conference for Disaster Risk Reduction Opening Ceremony","slug":"csafp-joins-asia-pacific-ministerial-conference-for-disaster-risk-reduction-opening-ceremony","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City— Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr, joined the Opening Ceremony of the Asia-Pacific Ministerial Conference for Disaster Risk Reduction (APMCDRR) held today at the Philippine International Convention Center, Pasay City.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/MIN1.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr engages with local delegates following the Opening Ceremony of the Asia-Pacific Ministerial Conference for Disaster Risk Reduction on October 15.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-10-15T09:31:33+08:00","hits":626},{"id":17,"title":"Philippines, US forces engage in joint sea exercises during SAMASAMA 2024","slug":"philippines-us-forces-engage-in-joint-sea-exercises-during-samasama-2024","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—Participating naval forces from the Philippines and the United States successfully conducted a series of advanced maritime drills on October 14 as part of Exercise SAMASAMA. Focusing on anti-submarine warfare and joint patrol operations, the exercise highlights both nations' commitment to enhancing interoperability and collective defense capabilities in maritime security.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/SAM1.jpg","image_caption":"Personnel of the BRP Jose Rizal (FF150) prepares the AW159 as part of the Exercise SAMASAMA on October 14 in the West Philippine Sea.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-10-15T09:29:49+08:00","hits":2286},{"id":18,"title":"AFP, Partners Commemorate Marawi Siege Heroes","slug":"afp-partners-commemorate-marawi-siege-heroes","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines with the National Parks Development Committee and Salute To A Clean Flag Movement (STACF), and in partnership with the Makati Medical Center (MakatiMed) Foundation, commemorated the bravery and resilience demonstrated during the Marawi Siege in a \"Stop and Salute\" Flag Raising Ceremony, held today at Rizal Park, Manila City.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/MAR1.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr honors the heroes of Marawi Siege in his address during the Flag Raising Ceremony on October 14, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-10-14T09:27:36+08:00","hits":580},{"id":19,"title":"Two Newly-Promoted Generals Commit to Greater Responsibilities at Donning of Ranks Ceremony","slug":"two-newly-promoted-generals-commit-to-greater-responsibilities-at-donning-of-ranks-ceremony","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—General Romeo S Brawner Jr., Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (CSAFP), donned new ranks to Brigadier General Francis Anthony M Coronel and Colonel Ferdinand Geminic P Ramirez, in a ceremony on October 9, 2024, here.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/PRO1.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr; Major General Francis Anthony M Coronel, Deputy Chief of Staff for Financial Management, J10; and Brigadier General Ferdinand Geminic P Ramirez, Commander of the AFP Reserve Command (AFPRESCOM), gather for a photo during the donning of ranks ceremony on October 9, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-10-09T09:25:21+08:00","hits":573},{"id":20,"title":"AFP, US forces deliver relief supplies to typhoon-hit Batanes, highlighting crucial disaster relief partnership","slug":"afp-us-forces-deliver-relief-supplies-to-typhoon-hit-batanes-highlighting-crucial-disaster-relief-partnership","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City – The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), in coordination with US military forces, delivered much-needed relief supplies to the communities of Batanes affected by Typhoon Julian on Tuesday, October 8.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/BAT1.jpg","image_caption":"Disaster relief items for typhoon victims donated by the US Agency for International Development were unloaded by US troops from an MV-22 Osprey at the Batanes Airport on Tuesday, October 8.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-10-08T09:23:36+08:00","hits":473},{"id":327,"title":"AFP Honors Soldier-Athletes for Sports Achievements","slug":"afp-honors-soldier-athletes-for-sports-achievements-2","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) honored the exceptional achievements of soldier-athletes in a recognition ceremony held today, here. The event was presided over by the AFP Vice Chief of Staff LtGen Arthur M Cordura representing the AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/ATH%201.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Vice Chief of Staff LtGen Arthur M Cordura awards the AFP Chief of Staff Commendation Medal to Paris 2024 Olympian ASN Joanie Delgaco during the recognition ceremony on October 7, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-10-08T07:40:40+08:00","hits":510},{"id":328,"title":"AFP Fosters Culture of Professionalism, Awards Units for Excellence","slug":"afp-fosters-culture-of-professionalism-awards-units-for-excellence","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) celebrated the exceptional achievements of AFP units and offices in a recognition ceremony held today, here. The event was presided over by the AFP Vice Chief of Staff LtGen Arthur M Cordura on behalf of the AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr., who underscored the commitment of the AFP as an institution of excellence.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/tr%201.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Vice Chief of Staff LtGen Arthur M Cordura and the awardees of the AFP Transformation Roadmap Institutionalization Pathway (AFPTRIP) pose for a photo during the recognition ceremony on October 7, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-10-07T15:43:49+08:00","hits":562},{"id":329,"title":"AFP, US Forces collaborate with Batanes Government for typhoon relief operations","slug":"afp-us-forces-collaborate-with-batanes-government-for-typhoon-relief-operations","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City – The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) together with the Joint US Military Assistance Group (JUSMAG) coordinated with the local government of Batanes on Saturday, October 5 to ensure effective relief operations in the aftermath of Typhoon Julian.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/BAT.jpg","image_caption":"The JUSMAG team led by Colonel Edward Evans together with Lieutenant Colonel Ariel Galimba from the Office of the Deputy Chief of Staff for Operations, AFP and a representative from the USAID make a courtesy visit to Batanes Governor Marilou Cayco on Saturday, October 5. (Photo from OJ3, AFP)","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-10-05T15:38:49+08:00","hits":345},{"id":330,"title":"AFP Bolsters Partnership with Thailand in Joint Exit and Introductory Visit of Naval Attachés","slug":"afp-bolsters-partnership-with-thailand-in-joint-exit-and-introductory-visit-of-naval-attaches","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines welcomed the outgoing and incoming Thailand Naval Attachés, CAPT Pakpoom Muensri RTN and CAPT Warintorn Kumhong, in a courtesy visit on October 4, 2024, here. The call was presided over by The AFP Inspector General, MGen Augustine S Malinit PAF, on behalf of AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/THA.jpg","image_caption":"The AFP Inspector General, MGen Augustine S Malinit PAF and Thailand’s incoming and outgoing Naval Attachés CAPT Warintorn Kumhong and CAPT Pakpoom Muensri RTN gather for a photo during a courtesy visit on October 4, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-10-04T15:37:03+08:00","hits":302},{"id":331,"title":"TDCSAFP Receives Honorary SEAL Badge in a Farewell Ceremony","slug":"tdcsafp-receives-honorary-seal-badge-in-a-farewell-ceremony","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City— The Deputy Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (TDCSAFP), Lieutenant General Charlton Sean M Gaerlan PN(M), was honored with an Honorary SEAL Rites following his Farewell Visit on October 3, 2024, at the Naval Special Operations Command (NAVSOCOM) Headquarters in Sangley Point, Cavite.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/NAVYS%201.jpg","image_caption":"LtGen Charlton Sean M Gaerlan PN(M), The AFP Deputy Chief of Staff participates with the Navy Seals in several exercises traditionally associated with Basic Underwater Demolition/SEAL (BUDS) training on October 3, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-10-04T15:34:56+08:00","hits":170},{"id":332,"title":"AFP conducts 3-day Enhanced Defense Resource Management System Workshop at WESCOM","slug":"afp-conducts-3-day-enhanced-defense-resource-management-system-workshop-at-wescom","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), through the Office of the Deputy Chief of Staff for Financial Management, OJ10, successfully concluded the Enhanced Defense Resource Management System (DRMS) Workshop for Calendar Year 2024 at Headquarters Western Command in Palawan on 03 October 2024. The three-day workshop, which commenced on 01 October, aimed to strengthen the financial management capabilities of AFP personnel.<br /></span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/FIN%202.jpg","image_caption":"The DRMS Joint Mobile Team and the participants from different units and offices of WESCOM, gather for a photo during the Closing Ceremony of the 3-day Enhanced DRMS Workshop on October 3, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-10-03T15:33:24+08:00","hits":302},{"id":333,"title":"AFP Reinforces Cyber Security in a Change of Command Ceremony","slug":"afp-reinforces-cyber-security-in-a-change-of-command-ceremony","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines formally welcomed Colonel Joey T Fontiveros PA(GSC) as the new Commander of the AFP Cyber Group in a Change of Command Ceremony, presided over by AFP Vice Chief of Staff LtGen Arthur M Cordura on October 03, 2024, here.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/CYB2%201.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Vice Chief of Staff LtGen Arthur M Cordura salutes Colonel Joey T Fontiveros PA(GSC), and BGen Walter P Icaro PA during the Change of Command Ceremony on October 3, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-10-03T15:30:24+08:00","hits":510},{"id":334,"title":"CSAFP Welcomes Czech Republic Ambassador in Pursuit of Stronger Defense Partnership","slug":"csafp-welcomes-czech-republic-ambassador-in-pursuit-of-stronger-defense-partnership","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines General Romeo S Brawner Jr welcomed His Excellency Karel Hejč Ambassador of Czech Republic to the Philippines in a courtesy visit, on October 03, here, aimed at enhancing defense cooperation between the two nations.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/CZE1.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr and His Excellency Karel Hejč Ambassador of Czech Republic to the Philippines sit in discussion during the latter’s courtesy visit on October 3, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-10-03T07:13:50+08:00","hits":231},{"id":335,"title":"AFP joins MANAMo, reinforces Philippine maritime interests","slug":"afp-joins-manamo-reinforces-philippine-maritime-interests","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City— The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) joined the first sessions of the Inaugural Balangay Forum: Safeguarding Philippine Maritime Interests, held today, here as a culminating activity for this year’s Maritime Archipelagic Nation Awareness Month (MANAMo). The AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr., participated in a panel discussion on the topic of protecting the Philippines’ maritime domain.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/October%202024/mana%201.jpg","image_caption":"Secretary of National Defense Gilberto Teodoro Jr presents a token of appreciation to AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr during the panel discussion at the Inaugural Balangay Forum: Safeguarding Philippine Maritime Interests in connection with the MANAMo 2024 celebration on September 30.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-30T15:13:41+08:00","hits":247},{"id":336,"title":"AFP Chief of Staff returns to Marawi, inspires troops to uphold sworn duty","slug":"afp-chief-of-staff-returns-to-marawi-inspires-troops-to-uphold-sworn-duty","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (CSAFP), General Romeo S Brawner Jr on September 28, 2024, returned to the 103rd Infantry Brigade in Marawi City, Lanao del Sur where he once served as Brigade Commander during the Marawi siege.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/MAR.jpg","image_caption":"General Brawner stands at the Marawi memorial marker on September 29, paying tribute to the brave soldiers who offered their lives during the Marawi Siege.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-29T14:27:55+08:00","hits":370},{"id":337,"title":"4th Multilateral Maritime Cooperative Activity within PH EEZ highlights regional cooperation","slug":"4th-multilateral-maritime-cooperative-activity-within-ph-eez-highlights-regional-cooperation","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- In a significant demonstration of international collaboration, the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), together with the armed and defense forces of Australia, Japan, New Zealand, and United States, successfully conducted a one-day Multilateral Maritime Cooperative Activity (MMCA) on September 28, 2024, within the Philippines' Exclusive Economic Zone (EEZ).</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/MMCA.jpg","image_caption":"This formation features (from left to right) HMNZS Aotearoa (A-11), BRP Antonio Luna (FF 151), USS Howard (DDG 83), HMAS Sydney (D 48), and JS Sazanami (DD 113), with BRP Emilio Jacinto (PS 35) as the break away vessel showcasing coordinated division tactics during the 4th MMCA on September 28.  Photo by CRSAFP","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-28T14:24:49+08:00","hits":321},{"id":338,"title":"4th Multilateral Maritime Cooperative Activity","slug":"4th-multilateral-maritime-cooperative-activity","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p>The combined armed and defense forces of Australia, Japan, New Zealand, the Philippines, and the United States, demonstrating a collective commitment to strengthen regional and international cooperation in support of a free and open Indo-Pacific, will conduct a Multilateral Maritime Cooperative Activity within the Philippines’ Exclusive Economic Zone on September 28, 2024.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/CSAFP%20MMCA%2027.jpg","image_caption":"The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), with the armed and defense forces of Australia, Japan, New Zealand, and United States will conduct a Multilateral Maritime Cooperative Activity today, September 28, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-28T14:22:33+08:00","hits":394},{"id":339,"title":"AFP welcomes JSDF Vice Chief of Staff","slug":"afp-welcomes-jsdf-vice-chief-of-staff","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"    <div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—LtGen Charlton Sean Gaerlan, The Deputy Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (TDCSAFP), welcomes Lieutenant General Nagumo Kenichiro, Vice Chief of Staff of Japan Self-Defense Force, at the sidelines of the 5th Asian Defense, Security, and Crisis Management Exhibition and Conference (ADAS 2024) on September 27 in Pasay City. The two discussed the enduring Philippine-Japan defense and security partnership and committed to further enhancing military relations in pursuit of a rules-based international order.</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">(Photo by SSg Amagan/PAOAFP)</div>\r\n</div>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/PHOR3.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-27T14:20:13+08:00","hits":162},{"id":340,"title":"AFP, PCG sustains PH presence at Ayungin Shoal","slug":"afp-pcg-sustains-ph-presence-at-ayungin-shoal","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), with support from the Philippine Coast Guard (PCG), delivered essential supplies and provisions to the personnel aboard the BRP Sierra Madre (LS 57) in Ayungin Shoal, and facilitated troop rotation on 26 September 2024.<br /><br /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">The AFP will continue to perform its mandates in the West Philippine Sea, and provide full support and care for our stationed troops.</div>\r\n</div>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/RORE.jpg","image_caption":"M/V Lapu-Lapu approaches BRP Sierra Madre during the rotation and resupply mission conducted by the AFP in collaboration with the PCG on 26 September 2024 at Ayungin Shoal.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-27T14:17:55+08:00","hits":216},{"id":341,"title":"CSAFP Receives Chief of Defense of Timor Leste","slug":"csafp-receives-chief-of-defense-of-timor-leste","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—General Romeo S. Brawner Jr., Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (CSAFP), speaks with Lieutenant General Domingos Raul, Chief of Defense of Timor Leste, during their meeting at the AFP General Headquarters here on September 26, 2024. The visit served as an opportunity for military leaders to discuss potential areas of cooperation in defense and security, with a focus on enhancing capabilities and promoting peace and stability within the region.<br /></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">(Photo by TSg Obinque/PAOAFP)</div>\r\n</div>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/PHOR2.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-27T14:16:40+08:00","hits":130},{"id":342,"title":"CSAFP welcomes TNI Commander","slug":"csafp-welcomes-tni-commander","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City--General Romeo S. Brawner Jr., Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (CSAFP), meets with General Agus Subiyanto, Commander of the Indonesian National Defence Forces (TNI), during the latter's courtesy visit at the AFP General Headquarters here on September 26, 2024. The visit provided an opportunity for both countries to explore areas of collaboration in defense and security, focusing on capacity building and the promotion of peace and stability in the region.<br /></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">(Photo by TSg Obinque/PAOAFP)</div>\r\n</div>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/PHOR1.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-27T14:15:25+08:00","hits":125},{"id":343,"title":"CSAFP joins opening of 5th ADAS","slug":"csafp-joins-opening-of-5th-adas","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City--General Romeo S. Brawner Jr., Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), led the AFP’s participation in the opening ceremony of the 5th Asian Defense, Security, and Crisis Management Exhibition and Conference (ADAS 2024) on September 25, 2024, at the World Trade Center, Pasay City. The event, which runs from September 25 to 27, brings together leaders in military technology innovation and key stakeholders in defense, security, and crisis management.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/AD1.jpg","image_caption":"General Romeo S. Brawner Jr., Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), visits the Turkish Aerospace Inc. booth in the 5th Asian Defense, Security, and Crisis Management Exhibition and Conference (ADAS 2024) on September 25, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-25T09:43:03+08:00","hits":232},{"id":344,"title":"AFP, National University forge partnership on education cooperation","slug":"afp-national-university-forge-partnership-on-education-cooperation","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) and National University Philippines (NUP) formalized a partnership through a Memorandum of Agreement ( MOA ) signing on September 24 at the General Headquarters here. The MOA institutionalizes a collaborative relationship aimed at advancing mutual development programs that benefit both the AFP and NUP communities.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/MOA.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Deputy Chief of Staff, LtGen Charlton Sean Gaerlan, and National University President Dr. Renato Carlos Ermita Jr. sign a Memorandum of Agreement on September 24 at the General Headquarters.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-24T09:41:02+08:00","hits":273},{"id":345,"title":"AFP commemorates National Peace Consciousness Month through Peace Symposium Caravan","slug":"afp-commemorates-national-peace-consciousness-month-through-peace-symposium-caravan","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), through its Peace and Development Office (PDO), joins the National Peace Consciousness Month celebration by launching a series of Peace Symposium Caravan with the theme, “Winning Peace and Stability: Empowering Minds, Enabling Transformation” last September 10 at the Air Education Training and Doctrine Command in Lipa City, Batangas.<br /></span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/pdo.jpg","image_caption":"Participants of the first leg of the Peace Symposium Caravan from the Air Education, Training and Doctrine Command (AETDC) of the Philippine Air Force in Lipa City, Batangas gather for a photo last September 10.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-21T11:12:21+08:00","hits":295},{"id":346,"title":"AFP Honors Lieutenant General Gaerlan with Testimonial Parade","slug":"afp-honors-lieutenant-general-gaerlan-with-testimonial-parade","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City – The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) rendered a testimonial parade and review in honor of retiring AFP Deputy Chief of Staff LtGen Charlton Sean M Gaerlan PN(M) on September 21, 2024, at the Philippine Military Academy, Baguio City.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/pon.jpg","image_caption":"The AFP Deputy Chief of Staff LtGen Charlton Sean M Gaerlan with RAdm Caesar Bernard N Valencia during the former's testimonial parade and review on September 21, 2024 at PMA, Baguio City.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-21T11:10:26+08:00","hits":550},{"id":347,"title":"PH, Singapore armed forces hold disaster response training","slug":"ph-singapore-armed-forces-hold-disaster-response-training","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) and Singapore Armed Force's Changi Regional Humanitarian Assistance and Disaster Relief Coordination Centre (RHCC) conducted a two-day tabletop exercise from September 18 to 19, 2024 at the Office of Civil Defense here. The exercise aimed to strengthen coordination and enhance interoperability during Humanitarian Assistance and Disaster Relief (HADR) operations between the AFP, RHCC, and other participating agencies</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/lkl.jpg","image_caption":"Participants from the Armed Forces of the Philippines and the Singapore Armed Forces pose for a photo during the Humanitarian Assistance and Disaster Relief tabletop exercise held on September 18-19 in Camp Aguinaldo, Quezon City.  Photo by SSg Ambay/PAOAFP","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-20T11:08:54+08:00","hits":297},{"id":348,"title":"AFP concludes this year’s Resource Management Mentoring Program","slug":"afp-concludes-this-year-s-resource-management-mentoring-program","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), through the Office of the Deputy Chief of Staff for Financial Management, OJ10, successfully concluded the Resource Management Mentoring Program (RMMP) on September 18, 2024.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/FM7.jpg","image_caption":"Personnel from the Office of the Deputy Chief of Staff for Financial Management, OJ10, led by Navy Captain Michael Barrion during the virtual Resource Management Mentoring Program organized by the OJ10 on September 17, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-19T11:06:52+08:00","hits":201},{"id":349,"title":"AFP honors civilian personnel in 124th Civil Service Anniversary","slug":"afp-honors-civilian-personnel-in-124th-civil-service-anniversary","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) marked the 124th Civil Service Anniversary with a ceremony held on September 17 here. The event, presided over by Major General Rommel Roldan, The Deputy Chief of Staff for Personnel, J1, highlighted the importance of civil service in nation-building and the critical role of AFP civilian personnel in the military organization.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/ch.jpg","image_caption":"Newly appointed civilian personnel take their oath during the 124th Civil Service Anniversary celebration on September 17 in Camp Aguinaldo, Quezon City.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-17T11:03:49+08:00","hits":279},{"id":350,"title":"CSAFP lauds 95th Infantry Battalion in recent internal security success","slug":"csafp-lauds-95th-infantry-battalion-in-recent-internal-security-success","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines, General Romeo Brawner Jr., lauded the troops of the 95th Infantry Battalion during his visit to their Tactical Command Post in Barangay Sisim, Peñablanca, Cagayan, on September 15, 2024. General Brawner congratulated the unit for their successful operation that led to a recent encounter with the New People's Army (NPA) in the area.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/PEN.jpg","image_caption":"The Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines, General Romeo Brawner Jr, talks to the troops of the 95th Infantry Battalion during his visit to their Tactical Command Post at Barangay Sisim, Peñablanca, Cagayan on September 15.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-15T14:57:41+08:00","hits":446},{"id":351,"title":"LtGen Crespillo retires, MGen Malinit takes over as Inspector General of AFP","slug":"ltgen-crespillo-retires-mgen-malinit-takes-over-as-inspector-general-of-afp","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"    <p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) held a Change of Chief of Office and retirement ceremony on 14 September 2024 at Camp Aguinaldo, honoring Lieutenant General Steve D. Crespillo as he stepped down from his post as Inspector General of the AFP. </p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/CRES.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo Brawner Jr hands over the office symbol of the Office of the Inspector General (OTIG) to MGen Augustine Malinit during the Retirement and Change of Chief of Office Ceremony on September 14 in Camp Aguinaldo, Quezon City.  Photo by SSg Amagan/PAOAFP","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-14T15:00:27+08:00","hits":723},{"id":352,"title":"AFP celebrates 45th National Reservist Week ","slug":"afp-celebrates-45th-national-reservist-week","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) concluded the 45th National Reservist Week with a culminating ceremony held on September 14 here, paying homage to the nation's reservists. </p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/RES.jpg","image_caption":"The Search and Rescue Unit, 1303rd Ready Reserve Battalion conducts a capability demonstration during the culminating activity of the 45th National Reservist Week on September 14 in Camp Aguinaldo, Quezon City.  Photo by SSg Ambay/PAOAFP","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-14T14:55:00+08:00","hits":540},{"id":353,"title":"Secretary Teodoro, General Brawner inspect defense facilities in Palawan","slug":"secretary-teodoro-general-brawner-inspect-defense-facilities-in-palawan","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"    <p>CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City--Secretary of National Defense Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr. and AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo Brawner Jr. visited key naval facilities in Oyster Bay in Palawan on September 12, 2024, to assess ongoing infrastructure developments critical to enhancing the country’s external defense posture.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/CSPAL.jpg","image_caption":"Secretary of National Defense Gilberto Teodoro Jr and top military officers of the AFP led by the Chief of Staff General Romeo Brawner Jr pose for a photo with the personnel at Naval Detachment Oyster Bay during their visit on September 12.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-13T03:10:10+08:00","hits":394},{"id":354,"title":"AFP Welcomes India's Defence Secretary Shri Giridhar Aramane","slug":"afp-welcomes-indias-defence-secretary-shri-giridhar-aramane","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) welcomed Shri Giridhar Aramane, Defence Secretary of India, during his courtesy visit to the AFP General Headquarters on September 11, 2024. Shri Aramane, along with the Indian defense and military delegation, was received by the Vice Chief of Staff of the AFP, Lieutenant General Arthur Cordura, and senior military officers of the AFP.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/INDS.jpg","image_caption":"The Armed Forces of the Philippines renders arrival honors led by the Vice Chief of Staff of the AFP, Lieutenant General Arthur Cordura, to Shri Giridhar Aramane, Defence Secretary of India during his courtesy visit to the AFP General Headquarters on September 11, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-12T14:15:24+08:00","hits":281},{"id":355,"title":"AFP Opens Financial Management Course to Enhance Fund Management Skills","slug":"afp-opens-financial-management-course-to-enhance-fund-management-skills","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), through the Office of the Deputy Chief of Staff for Financial Management, J10, and the AFP Education, Training and Doctrine Command (AFPETDC), officially opened the AFP Financial Management Course (AFP FMC) Class 34-2024 on September 10, 2024.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/FINMC4.jpg","image_caption":"Participants and facilitators of the AFP Financial Management Course (AFP FMC) Class 34-2024 pose for a photo during the opening ceremony on September 10, 2024 in Camp Aguinaldo, Quezon City.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-12T11:07:09+08:00","hits":451},{"id":356,"title":"VCSAFP Welcomes New AFP Medical Center Chief","slug":"vcsafp-welcomes-new-afp-medical-center-chief","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines formally welcomed Colonel Jonna D Dalaguit MC (GSC) as the new Chief of the AFP Medical Center in a Change of Command Ceremony presided over by AFP Vice Chief of Staff, LtGen Arthur M Cordura on September 11, 2024, at V. Luna Avenue, Quezon City.<br /></span></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/MED4.jpg","image_caption":"Colonel Jonna D Dalaguit MC (GSC) incoming Chief of AFP Medical Center, receives the symbol of leadership from AFP Vice Chief of Staff LtGen Arthur M Cordura, during the Change of Command Ceremony on September 11, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-12T06:15:17+08:00","hits":779},{"id":357,"title":"AFP, Metrobank Foundation honor outstanding soldiers","slug":"afp-metrobank-foundation-honor-outstanding-soldiers","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City–The Armed Forces of the Philippines joined the Metrobank Foundation Inc. to celebrate the 2024 Metrobank Foundation for Outstanding Filipinos – Award for Soldiers (MFOFAS) on September 11, here. The ceremony was attended by LtGen Charlton Sean M Gaerlan, The AFP Deputy Chief of Staff as Guest of Honor and Speaker.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/MET1.jpg","image_caption":"LtGen Charlton Sean M Gaerlan, The Deputy Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines, Mr. Aniceto M Sobrepeña, President of the Metrobank Foundation Inc., AFP senior officers and stakeholders, and the 2024 MFOFAS awardees gather for a photo on September 11.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-11T14:13:08+08:00","hits":226},{"id":358,"title":"AFP, Indian Armed Forces renew defense cooperation","slug":"afp-indian-armed-forces-renew-defense-cooperation","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City–The Armed Forces of the Philippines and Indian Armed Forces renewed their commitment to a robust defense collaboration during the 3rd Service-to-Service (STS) Meeting, on September 10, 2024, here.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/IND2.jpg","image_caption":"BGen Rommel R Cordova, Acting Deputy Chief of Staff for Plans, J5, presents a token of appreciation to Commodore Deepinder Singh Dutt during the 3rd Service-to-Service (STS) Meeting on September 10, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-11T14:10:55+08:00","hits":270},{"id":359,"title":"AFP welcomes staff, students of Defense Services Command and Staff College of Bangladesh","slug":"afp-welcomes-staff-students-of-defense-services-command-and-staff-college-of-bangladesh","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) hosted a courtesy visit from students and staff of the Defense Services Command and Staff College (DSCSC) of Bangladesh on September 10, 2024, at the AFP General Headquarters here. </p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/DSC3.jpg","image_caption":"Acting Chief of Staff of the AFP Lieutenant General Arthur Cordura speaks with Colonel Mohammad Zahid Hossain during the courtesy visit of students and staff of the Defense Services Command and Staff College (DSCSC) of Bangladesh on September 10, 2024, at the AFP General Headquarters.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-10T06:59:08+08:00","hits":201},{"id":360,"title":"CSAFP Welcomes U.S. Marine Corps Commandant ","slug":"csafp-welcomes-u-s-marine-corps-commandant","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City–The Vice Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines LtGen Arthur M Cordura welcomed General Eric M Smith, Commandant of United States Marine Corps (USMC) in a courtesy visit on September 9, 2024, here. </p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/USMC4.jpg","image_caption":"LtGen Arthur M Cordura, AFP Vice Chief of Staff welcomes General Eric M Smith, Commandant of U.S. Marine Corps, during the latter’s courtesy call on September 9, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-09T14:59:24+08:00","hits":227},{"id":361,"title":"AFP kicks off National Reservist Week celebration with Simultaneous Fun Run","slug":"afp-kicks-off-national-reservist-week-celebration-with-simultaneous-fun-run","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) launched the celebration of the National Reservist Week (NRW) with a simultaneous Fun Run held in military camps nationwide on September 7, 2024. </p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/FR.jpg","image_caption":"Active AFP members, Reservists, Civilian Human Resources and running enthusiats join the National Reservist Week Fun Run on September 7, 2024 at the Lapulapu Grandstand in Camp Aguinaldo, Quezon City. (Photo by: SSg Amagan PA/PAOAFP)","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-08T14:57:40+08:00","hits":563},{"id":362,"title":"Message of the AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr on the 124th Philippine Civil Service Anniversary","slug":"message-of-the-afp-chief-of-staff-general-romeo-s-brawner-jr-on-the-124th-philippine-civil-service-anniversary","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p>Message of the AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr on the 124th Philippine Civil Service Anniversary</p>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/CSSTAT.jpg","image_caption":"Message of the AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr on the 124th Philippine Civil Service Anniversary","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-07T14:55:56+08:00","hits":228},{"id":363,"title":"AFP honors MGen Hechanova in Change of Chief of Office and Retirement Ceremony","slug":"afp-honors-mgen-hechanova-in-change-of-chief-of-office-and-retirement-ceremony","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) held a Change of Chief of Office Ceremony on September 6 here to honor the retirement of Major General Jeffrey Hechanova, the outgoing Deputy Chief of Staff for Plans, J5, AFP. He was succeeded by his assistant, Brigadier General Rommel Cordova, who will serve in an acting capacity.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/hec.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Vice Chief of Staff LtGen Arthur Cordura turns over the office symbol of the Office of the Deputy Chief of Staff for Plans, OJ5, to BGen Rommel Cordova during their Change of Chief of Office and Retirement Ceremony on September 6 in Camp Aguinaldo, Quezon City.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-07T14:54:36+08:00","hits":347},{"id":364,"title":"AFP Joins the Nurse Corps and MNAP’s Anniversary Celebration","slug":"afp-joins-the-nurse-corps-and-mnap-s-anniversary-celebration","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) celebrated the 86th founding anniversary of the Nurse Corps and the 59th year of the Military Nurse Association of the Philippines (MNAP) in a joint ceremony on September 5, 2024, here. The event was graced by MGen Joel Alejandro S Nacnac, Deputy Chief of Staff for Reservist and Retiree Affairs, J9, as Guest of Honor and Speaker.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/NC3.jpg","image_caption":"MGen Joel Alejandro S Nacnac, Deputy Chief of Staff for Reservist and Retiree Affairs, J9; The AFP Chief Nurse BGen Ma. Dolores M Lim; and the members of the Nurse Corps and MNAP, pose for a photo on September 5.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-05T09:23:46+08:00","hits":393},{"id":365,"title":"CA confirms ad interim appointments of 32 AFP generals, flag officers","slug":"ca-confirms-ad-interim-appointments-of-32-afp-generals-flag-officers","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—Thirty-two generals, flag officers, and senior officers of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) received confirmation of their ad interim appointments and promotions by the Commission on Appointments (CA) during the plenary session on September 4, 2024.<br /></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/CA2.jpg","image_caption":"Senior military officers pose for a photo during the deliberation of the ad interim appointments at the Commission on Appointments on September 4.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-05T09:22:08+08:00","hits":357},{"id":366,"title":"Soldier-Athletes Pay Courtesy Visit to AFP","slug":"soldier-athletes-pay-courtesy-visit-to-afp","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Vice Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines, LtGen Arthur M Cordura received the World Eskrima Kali Arnis Federation (WEKAF) and Paris Olympics soldier-athletes in a courtesy visit on September 4, 2024, here.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/ATH.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Vice Chief of Staff LtGen Arthur M Cordura along with WEKAF and Paris Olympics soldier-athletes, gather for a photo in a courtesy visit on September 4, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-04T09:38:03+08:00","hits":242},{"id":367,"title":"US Defense Technology Security Administration conducts final security survey of AFP units","slug":"us-defense-technology-security-administration-conducts-final-security-survey-of-afp-units","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—A team from the United States Defense Technology Security Administration (DTSA) and the U.S. Indo-Pacific Command (USINDOPACOM) commenced the final Security Assistance Visit (SAV) to selected units of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) on September 3, 2024. The survey is a critical step towards finalizing the General Security of Military Information Agreement (GSOMIA) between the Philippines and the United States.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/def.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Vice Chief of Staff LtGen Arthur Cordura and Mr Steve James of the US Defense Technology Security Administration and US Indo-Pacific Command staff pose for a photo following the Final Security Assistance Visit to the AFP General Headquarters on September 3.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-04T09:35:03+08:00","hits":285},{"id":368,"title":"AFP Readies Personnel and Assets in Response to Tropical Storm “Enteng”","slug":"afp-readies-personnel-and-assets-in-response-to-tropical-storm-enteng","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) in the National Capital Region has activated its disaster response units and mobilized personnel and assets to respond to the potential impacts of Tropical Storm “Enteng.”</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/ENT.jpg","image_caption":"Rescuers of the Armed Forces of the Philippines and Bureau of Fire Protection conduct a rescue operation at Brgy Loyola Heights in Quezon City on September 2.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-02T10:47:16+08:00","hits":232},{"id":369,"title":"AFP Celebrates the 45th National Reservist Week","slug":"afp-celebrates-the-45th-national-reservist-week","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City— The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), through the AFP Reservist and Retiree Affairs Office (OJ9), held a press conference today, here, as part of the commemoration of the 45th National Reservist Week (NRW) 2024. This year's theme, “Tatak ng Laang Kawal para sa Bagong Pilipinas,” celebrates the invaluable contributions of the AFP Reservists in the country’s defense posture.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/September%202024/NRW.jpg","image_caption":"Deputy Chief of Staff for RRA, J9, MGen Joel Alejandro S Nacnac addresses the media during the Press Conference for the NRW 2024 on September 2.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-09-02T10:44:33+08:00","hits":251},{"id":370,"title":"AFP Hosts Heroes Run 2024","slug":"afp-hosts-heroes-run-2024","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) led the successful conduct of the Heroes Run 2024 today, August 31 at the Lapu-Lapu Grandstand, here.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/HR.jpg","image_caption":"Deputy Chief of Staff for Personnel, J1 MGen Rommel P Roldan PAF and Mr Dominic Lacbayo from the Political Affairs Office of Senator Juan Miguel Zubiri awarded the winners of the 400m run kids category.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-31T10:41:17+08:00","hits":289},{"id":371,"title":"General Brawner Celebrates WESMINCOM’s 18th Anniversary","slug":"general-brawner-celebrates-wesmincom-s-18th-anniversary","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr PA, visited the Western Mindanao Command (WESMINCOM) as the Guest of Honor and Speaker during the command’s 18th founding anniversary celebration today, August 31.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/WESMCM.jpg","image_caption":"The AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr PA congratulates Gold Cross Medal recipient, Sgt Winston T Tangilan PA.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-31T10:37:44+08:00","hits":152},{"id":372,"title":"AFP welcomes CGSC Class 74 graduates","slug":"afp-welcomes-cgsc-class-74-graduates","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Command and General Staff Course (CGSC) Class 74 of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) graduated in a ceremony held on August 30, 2024, at Camp Aguinaldo. Chief of Staff AFP General Romeo Brawner Jr. served as the Guest of Honor and Speaker.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/CGSC.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo Brawner Jr delivers his remarks in the graduation ceremony of Command and General Staff Course (CGSC) Class 74 held on August 30, 2024, at Camp Aguinaldo.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-30T10:35:45+08:00","hits":232},{"id":373,"title":"AFP, USINDOPACOM lead MDB-SEB meeting in Baguio City","slug":"afp-usindopacom-lead-mdb-seb-meeting-in-baguio-city","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) and the United States Indo-Pacific Command (USINDOPACOM) convened the Mutual Defense Board and Security Engagement Board (MDB-SEB) Meeting at the Philippine Military Academy (PMA) in Baguio City on August 29, 2024. The meeting was presided over by General Romeo Brawner Jr., Chief of Staff of the AFP, and Admiral Samuel John Paparo Jr., Commander of the USINDOPACOM.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/MDBSEB.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr. and USINDOPACOM Commander Admiral Samuel John Paparo Jr. signs the list of 2025 activities following the MDB-SEB meeting on August 29, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-29T10:32:38+08:00","hits":207},{"id":374,"title":"AFP Holds Change of Command and Retirement Ceremony for Office of the Chief Engineer","slug":"afp-holds-change-of-command-and-retirement-ceremony-for-office-of-the-chief-engineer","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) conducted a Change of Command and Retirement Ceremony for the Office of the Chief Engineer (OTCE) on August 28, 2024, at Camp Aguinaldo, Quezon City. The event marked the retirement of Major General Proceso Rebancos from military service and the designation of Colonel Ricnon Carolasan as the Acting Chief Engineer.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/CE.jpg","image_caption":"The officers, enlisted personnel, and civilian employees of the Office of the Chief Engineer pose for a photo during the Change of Command and Retirement Ceremony on August 28, 2024, at Camp Aguinaldo, Quezon City.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-29T10:30:47+08:00","hits":485},{"id":375,"title":"Gen Brawner, Adm Paparo visit EDCA facilities at Basa Air Base","slug":"gen-brawner-adm-paparo-visit-edca-facilities-at-basa-air-base","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City— The Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (CSAFP) General Romeo Brawner Jr. and the Commander of the U.S. Indo-Pacific Command Admiral Samuel Paparo visited Basa Air Base in Pampanga on August 28, 2024, as part of their ongoing engagements under the Mutual Defense Board-Security Engagement Board (MDB-SEB) meeting.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/EDCABAS.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr. and USINDOPACOM Commander Admiral Samuel Paparo, board the PAF’s FA-50 jet on August 28, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-28T10:28:35+08:00","hits":175},{"id":376,"title":"AFP hosts 35th International Military Law and Operations Conference","slug":"afp-hosts-35th-international-military-law-and-operations-conference","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The 35th International Military Law and Operations Conference (MILOPS 24) convened on August 27, 2024, at Rigodon Hall, Manila Hotel, bringing together senior military leaders, government officials, legal advisors, and leading academics from over 20 nations across the Indo-Pacific region. The conference serves as a vital platform for discussing key aspects of international law, military cooperation, and the significance of a rules-based international order.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/IML.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo Brawner Jr speaks during the 35th International Military Law and Operations Conference (MILOPS 24) convened on August 27, 2024, at Rigodon Hall, Manila Hotel.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-28T10:25:25+08:00","hits":236},{"id":377,"title":"AFP, The Manila Times Honors Filipino Soldiers","slug":"afp-the-manila-times-honors-filipino-soldiers","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines with The Manila Times honored the dedication and sacrifices of Filipino soldiers with an awarding ceremony themed “Tribute to Soldiers” on August 26, 2024, at The Manila Hotel. The event was held in line with the commemoration of National Heroes Day, graced by AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr. as Guest of Honor and Speaker.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/MNLT.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr. congratulates the awardees during the Tribute to Soldiers event on August 26, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-27T10:23:12+08:00","hits":189},{"id":378,"title":"AFP Joins the Commemoration of National Heroes Day","slug":"afp-joins-the-commemoration-of-national-heroes-day","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City— The Armed Forces of the Philippines joined President Ferdinand Marcos Jr. and the entire nation in commemorating National Heroes Day today, August 26 at the Libingan ng mga Bayani, Taguig City.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/NHD.jpg","image_caption":"President Ferdinand Marcos Jr. and AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr. render their salute, honoring our national heroes on August 26, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-26T10:20:42+08:00","hits":238},{"id":379,"title":"AFP hosts 25th MSGC Meeting","slug":"afp-hosts-25th-msgc-meeting","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) successfully hosted the 25th Multi-Sector Governance Council (MSGC) meeting at the AFP General Headquarters on August 22 here that is part of ongoing efforts to further strengthen governance, transparency, and accountability within the AFP.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/msgc.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff, General Romeo Brawner Jr speaks during the 25th Multi-Sector Governance Council (MSGC) meeting at the AFP General Headquarters on August 22 in Camp Aguinaldo, Quezon City.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-22T10:18:25+08:00","hits":150},{"id":380,"title":"AFP holds Change of Chief of Office and Retirement Ceremony of Chief Financial Manager ","slug":"afp-holds-change-of-chief-of-office-and-retirement-ceremony-of-chief-financial-manager","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) held a joint ceremony to mark the retirement of Major General Rolando E. Nerona, Deputy Chief of Staff for Financial Management, J10, and the appointment of Brigadier General Francis Anthony M. Coronel as the new J10 chief on August 20 here. The event was presided over by AFP's Deputy Chief of Staff, Lieutenant General Charlton Sean M. Gaerlan.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/CCOM%201.jpg","image_caption":"AFP's Deputy Chief of Staff LtGen Charlton Sean M Gaerlan hands over the honorary symbol of responsibility to incoming J10, BGen Francis Anthony M Coronel, during the change of chief of office ceremony on August 20, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-21T10:33:21+08:00","hits":924},{"id":381,"title":"AFP meets with PCW and OPAPRU to enhance gender, peace Initiative","slug":"afp-meets-with-pcw-and-opapru-to-enhance-gender-peace-initiative","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) held a joint meeting with representatives from the Philippine Commission on Women (PCW) and the Office of the Presidential Adviser on Peace, Reconciliation, and Unity (OPAPRU) on August 20 at the AFP General Headquarters here. The meeting aimed to strengthen collaboration in advancing gender-responsive initiatives and peacebuilding efforts within the AFP and across the country.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/GOPAP1.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo Brawner Jr speaks during his meeting with representatives from the Office of the Presidential Adviser on Peace, Reconciliation, and Unity and the Philippine Commission on Women on August 20 in Camp Aguinaldo, Quezon City.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-21T10:31:38+08:00","hits":384},{"id":382,"title":"AFP Joins Philippine ROTC Games 2024 National Championship","slug":"afp-joins-philippine-rotc-games-2024-national-championship","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) joined the Opening Ceremony of the Philippine ROTC Games 2024 National Championship on August 18, 2024 at Cavite State University, Indang Cavite. The event was graced by Senator Jinggoy Estrada as Guest of Honor and Speaker. </p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/ROT1.jpg","image_caption":"Senator Francis Tolentino, AFP personnel, stakeholders, and athletes gather for a photo during the Opening Ceremony of the Philippine ROTC Games 2024 National Championship on August 18, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-20T10:27:50+08:00","hits":532},{"id":383,"title":"AFP Chief of Staff becomes Honorary Navy SEAL","slug":"afp-chief-of-staff-becomes-honorary-navy-seal","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City – General Romeo S. Brawner Jr. PA, Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), became an honorary member of the Philippine Navy's elite special operations forces after completing the Philippine Navy SEAL rites on Monday, August 19 at the Naval Special Operations Command (NAVSOCOM) headquarters in Sangley Point, Cavite. </p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/SEAL.jpg","image_caption":"General Romeo S Brawner Jr, AFP Chief of Staff participated in several exercises traditionally associated with Basic Underwater Demolition/SEAL (BUDS) training at the NAVSOCOM, Sangley Point, Cavite on August 19. (Photo by SSg Ambay/PAOAFP)","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-19T14:59:43+08:00","hits":712},{"id":384,"title":"AFP Donates Four Million Pesos to GMA Kapuso Foundation","slug":"afp-donates-four-million-pesos-to-gma-kapuso-foundation","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) and its members have once again demonstrated their unwavering commitment to supporting disaster relief efforts by donating a total of four million pesos to the GMA Kapuso Foundation Inc. (GMAKFI).</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/gma.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo Brawner Jr donates his blood during GMA Kapuso Foundation's Sagip Dugtong Buhay bloodletting event on August 17, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-17T14:56:30+08:00","hits":284},{"id":385,"title":"ICCMN Caravan opens in Lanao Del Norte to support Bangsamoro peace","slug":"iccmn-caravan-opens-in-lanao-del-norte-to-support-bangsamoro-peace","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) Chief of Staff, General Romeo Brawner Jr., delivered a message of support during the opening ceremony of the Inter-Cabinet Cluster Mechanism on Normalization (ICCMN) Caravan at Camp Bilal, Barangay Tamparan, Munai, Lanao Del Norte, on August 15, 2024.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/CAR1.jpg","image_caption":"OPAPRU Secretary Carlito Galvez Jr, AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo Brawner Jr, and Bangsamoro Transition Authority Parliament Member Abdullah G Macapaar stand in prayer with regional leaders during the opening ceremony for the Inter-Cabinet Cluster Mechanism on Normalization (ICCMN) Caravan at Camp Bilal, Barangay Tamparan, Munai, Lanao Del Norte, on August 15, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-15T07:40:19+08:00","hits":397},{"id":386,"title":"AFP Installs New AFPRESCOM Commander","slug":"afp-installs-new-afprescom-commander","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) welcomed Colonel Ferdinand Geminic P Ramirez as the new Commander of AFP Reserve Command and honored the outgoing commander, BGen Vicente M Ronatay in a joint ceremony held on August 14, here. </p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/RES2.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Vice Chief of Staff LtGen Arthur M Cordura hands over the Command Flag to Col Ferdinand Geminic P Ramirez from BGen Vicente M Ronatay, the outgoing AFPRESCOM Commander during the change of command ceremony on August 14, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-15T06:42:12+08:00","hits":992},{"id":387,"title":"Spanish Defense Attachés Pay Courtesy Call to AFP Chief of Staff","slug":"spanish-defense-attaches-pay-courtesy-call-to-afp-chief-of-staff","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) Chief of Staff, General Romeo Brawner Jr., welcomed the incoming and outgoing Defense Attachés of Spain to the Philippines during a courtesy call held on August 14, 2024, at the AFP General Headquarters here.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/SPA.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo Brawner Jr and Col Javier Martin Gil, the outgoing Defense Attaché of Spain, during the latter's courtesy visit at the AFP General Headquarters in Quezon City on August 14.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-14T14:51:27+08:00","hits":413},{"id":388,"title":"AFP Holds GSOMIA Leveling Workshop to Advance Security Standards","slug":"afp-holds-gsomia-leveling-workshop-to-advance-security-standards","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) conducted a General Security of Military Information Agreement (GSOMIA) Leveling Workshop with the aim of enhancing the implementation of GSOMIA- Collaborative Execution Plan (CEP) on August 1, 2024, here.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/GSOL2.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr. and participants of GSOMIA Leveling Workshop gather for a photo on August 1, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-14T03:04:09+08:00","hits":1014},{"id":389,"title":"AFP Joins Kapihan sa Bagong Pilipinas","slug":"afp-joins-kapihan-sa-bagong-pilipinas","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) joined the Kapihan sa Bagong Pilipinas, a communication initiative of the Presidential Communications Office (PCO) through the Philippine Information Agency (PIA) held on August 13, 2024, here. At the AFP General Headquarters, AFP Spokesperson Colonel Francel Margareth Padilla participated as the designated resource person.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/KBP1.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Spokesperson Colonel Francel Margareth Padilla sits in discussion with Mr. Emver Cortez, Regional Head of PIA-NCR during the Kapihan sa Bagong Pilipinas on August 13, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-13T08:38:29+08:00","hits":987},{"id":390,"title":"AFP honors Philippine Air Force contingent to Exercise Pitch Black 2024","slug":"afp-honors-philippine-air-force-contingent-to-exercise-pitch-black-2024","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) held a welcome and recognition ceremony on August 13 at Tejeros Hall here to honor the officers and enlisted personnel of the Philippine Air Force (PAF) who participated in Exercise Pitch Black 2024, in a fitting tribute to the PAF contingent's exemplary performance in what was the largest and most intense iteration of the exercise in its 43-year history.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/PB5.jpg","image_caption":"Col Randy Pascua, Deputy Commander of 5th Fighter Wing and Contingent Commander to the Exercise Pitch Black 2024, presents the exercise patch to Australian Ambassador Hae Kyong Yu during the welcome and recognition ceremony for Exercise Pitch Black 2024 participants on August 13 in Camp Aguinaldo, Quezon City.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-13T08:34:56+08:00","hits":438},{"id":391,"title":"AFP Conducts GSOMIA-CEP 2nd Staff Assistance Visit ","slug":"afp-conducts-gsomia-cep-2nd-staff-assistance-visit","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p>CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) conducted the General Security of Military Information Agreement (GSOMIA) and Collaborative Execution Plan (CEP), with its 2nd Staff Assistance Visit headed by the AFP Vice Chief of Staff, and AFP GSOMIA CEPIC Chairperson, LtGen Arthur M Cordura on August 12, 2024, here. </p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/GSO3.jpg","image_caption":"The AFP GSOMIA CEP Implementation Committee with the U.S. Staff Assistance Team gather for a photo during the GSOMIA-CEP 2nd Staff Assistance Visit on August 12, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-13T05:46:29+08:00","hits":331},{"id":392,"title":"Multilateral Maritime Cooperative Activity Concludes Successfully in WESCOM AOR","slug":"multilateral-maritime-cooperative-activity-concludes-successfully-in-wescom-aor","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), in collaboration with the armed forces of Australia, Canada, and the United States, successfully concluded the Multilateral Maritime Cooperative Activity (MCA) in the Western Command (WESCOM) Area of Responsibility within the Philippine Exclusive Economic Zone on August 8, 2024.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/MMCACLOP1.jpg","image_caption":"Philippine Navy personnel aboard BRP Jose Rizal (FF150) salute to their counterparts in the passing exercise that concludes the AUS-CAN-PH-US Multilateral Maritime Cooperative Activity held in the West Philippine Sea on August 8.  Photo by LTC SALGADO/PAOAFP","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-09T06:03:18+08:00","hits":558},{"id":393,"title":"Multilateral Maritime Cooperative activity held in WESCOM AOR","slug":"multilateral-maritime-cooperative-activity-held-in-wescom-aor","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), in collaboration with the armed forces of Australia,  Canada, and United States of America is currently conducting a Multilateral Maritime Cooperative Activity (MCA) in the Western Command (WESCOM) within Philippine exclusive economic zone.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/MMCAP8.jpg","image_caption":"Philippine Navy personnel watch the Canadian vessel HMCS Montreal (FFH336) during the Multilateral Maritime Cooperative Activity being held in the West Philippine Sea from August 7 to 8.  Photo by PFC Carmelotes/PAOAFP","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-07T09:27:28+08:00","hits":487},{"id":394,"title":"Joint Special Operations Group Celebrates 21st Anniversary","slug":"joint-special-operations-group-celebrates-21st-anniversary","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Joint Special Operations Group (JSOG) of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) celebrated its anniversary on August 7, 2024, with a ceremony held at Tejeros Hall here. General Romeo Brawner Jr., Chief of Staff of the AFP, graced the event as the Guest of Honor and Speaker.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/JSOG5.jpg","image_caption":"Senior military officers of the Armed Forces of the Philippines pose for a photo with the officers and enlisted personnel of the Joint Special Operations Group during their 21st anniversary celebration on August 7 in Camp Aguinaldo, Quezon City.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-07T09:25:13+08:00","hits":690},{"id":395,"title":"JOINT STATEMENT | Multilateral Maritime Cooperative Activity Joint Statement","slug":"joint-statement-multilateral-maritime-cooperative-activity-joint-statement","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Australia, Canada, the Philippines, and the United States uphold the right to freedom of navigation and overflight, other lawful uses of the sea and international airspace, as well as respect for maritime rights under international law, as reflected in the UN Convention on the Law of the Sea (UNCLOS).</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/JS-MCA3%201.png","image_caption":"Joint Statement by Australia, Canada, the Philippines and the United States on Multilateral Maritime Cooperative Activity within the Philippines' Exclusive Economic Zone on August 7 and 8, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-07T02:44:37+08:00","hits":466},{"id":396,"title":"AFP Joins Corps of Professors’ 83rd Anniversary","slug":"afp-joins-corps-of-professors-83rd-anniversary","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines celebrated the 83rd founding anniversary of the Corps of Professors on August 5, 2024, here. The event was graced by AFP Chief of Staff Romeo S Brawner Jr. as Guest of Honor and Speaker. </p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/coop.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief General Romeo Brawner Jr., AFP Deputy Chief of Staff LtGen Charlton Sean Gaerlan, and the members of the Corps of Professors pose for a photo during the COP's 83rd founding anniversary on August 5, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-06T10:52:07+08:00","hits":253},{"id":397,"title":"AFP Reaffirms Commitment to International Humanitarian Law","slug":"afp-reaffirms-commitment-to-international-humanitarian-law","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines reaffirmed its commitment to a month-long commemoration of the International Humanitarian Law with an oath-taking ceremony on August 5, 2024, here.</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/IHL1.jpg","image_caption":"Civilian human resources of the General Headquarters sing the National Anthem during the oath-taking ceremony on August 5, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-06T10:50:07+08:00","hits":430},{"id":398,"title":"AFP Honors Soldier-athletes in a Recognition Ceremony","slug":"afp-honors-soldier-athletes-in-a-recognition-ceremony","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (CSAFP), General Romeo S Brawner Jr., recognized the achievements of the AFP Lady Gunnar and AFP Cavaliers Basketball Team in a ceremony held on August 5, 2024, here.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/HON.jpg","image_caption":"The Victoriano Luna Medical Center receives the donation from the AFP Lady Gunnar during the Recognition Ceremony on August 5, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-05T05:51:35+08:00","hits":244},{"id":399,"title":"AFP Chief of Staff attends Philippines-Germany Bilateral Meeting","slug":"afp-chief-of-staff-attends-philippines-germany-bilateral-meeting","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City - General Romeo S Brawner Jr, Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), attended a significant bilateral meeting between the Philippines and Germany held today in Makati City. </p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/PHGE.jpg","image_caption":"General Romeo S. Brawner Jr. and German Defense Minister Boris Pistorius shake hands during the Philippines-Germany Bilateral Meeting on August 04, 2024. (Photo by: SSg Ambay PA / PAOAFP)","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-04T13:52:28+08:00","hits":329},{"id":400,"title":"AFP, other agencies, stakeholders join Exercise Tempest Wind 2024 SMEE","slug":"afp-other-agencies-stakeholders-join-exercise-tempest-wind-2024-smee","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"    <p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) together with law enforcement and government agencies, as well as the private sector participated in the Exercise Tempest Wind 2024 Whole of Nation Crisis Response Subject Matter Expert Exchange (SMEE) on July 29 to August 2, at Conrad Hotel, Pasay City.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/TWIN.jpg","image_caption":"Participants of the Tempest Wind 2024 Whole of Nation Crisis Response Subject Matter Expert Exchange from different government agencies and civilian stakeholders gather for a photo on August 2.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-04T13:50:14+08:00","hits":929},{"id":401,"title":"Philippine Navy, JMSDF Conduct 1st Bilateral Maritime Cooperative Activity in West Philippine Sea","slug":"philippine-navy-jmsdf-conduct-1st-bilateral-maritime-cooperative-activity-in-west-philippine-sea","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines through the Philippine Navy (PN) and the Japan Maritime Self-Defense Force (JMSDF) conducted the first bilateral Maritime Cooperative Activity (MCA) on August 2, 2024, in the West Philippine Sea. This activity was part of the ongoing efforts to strengthen regional and international cooperation towards realizing a free and open Indo-Pacific.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/MCA2AUG1.jpg","image_caption":"A Philippine Navy personnel aboard BRP Jose Rizal (FF150) observes the JS Sazanami (DD 113) during the Philippine-Japan maritime cooperative activity on August 2 in the West Philippine Sea.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-02T07:31:42+08:00","hits":391},{"id":402,"title":"AFP Celebrates the 70th Anniversary of Dental Service","slug":"afp-celebrates-the-70th-anniversary-of-dental-service","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines celebrated the 70th founding anniversary of the Dental Service, marking seven decades of an immense dental healthcare system. The event was graced by General Romeo S Brawner Jr., AFP Chief of Staff, as Guest of Honor and Speaker on August 1, 2024, here.<br /></span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/August%202024/den%201.jpg","image_caption":"General Romeo S Brawner Jr. and BGen Angelica Torres, present an award to a Dental Service personnel during its 70th founding anniversary on August 1, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-01T10:06:14+08:00","hits":437},{"id":403,"title":"NDCP Conducts the 29th Executive Course on National Security","slug":"ndcp-conducts-the-29th-executive-course-on-national-security-2","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The National Defense College of the Philippines (NDCP) conducted the 29th Executive Course on National Security with the topic “Sources of National Power of the Military,” attended by BGen Joel Paloma, Chief of Office for Strategic Studies and Strategy Management (OSSSM), AFP, representing General Romeo Brawner Jr., AFP Chief, as Speaker on July 31, 2024, here. </p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/July%202024/CNS1.jpg","image_caption":"BGen Joel Paloma, Chief of OSSSM, presents his lecture during the 29th Executive Course on National Security on July 31, 2024.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-08-01T07:07:22+08:00","hits":727},{"id":404,"title":"Maritime Cooperative Activity Commences in the West Philippine Sea","slug":"maritime-cooperative-activity-commences-in-the-west-philippine-sea","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), in collaboration with the United States Navy, held a Maritime Cooperative Activity on Wednesday afternoon, July 31, in the West Philippine Sea.<br /></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">The activity was held inside the Philippine exclusive economic zone, in the waters west of Palawan. It featured the USS Mobile (LCS 26) and the BRP Ramon Alcaraz (PS16).","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/July%202024/signal-2024-07-31-203721_003%201.jpeg","image_caption":"A Philippine Navy personnel aboard BRP Ramon Alcaraz (PS16) signals to the USS Mobile (LCS 26) as they conduct division tactics/officer of the watch maneuver exercise in the maritime cooperative activity on July 31 in the West Philippine Sea.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-07-31T13:55:30+08:00","hits":534},{"id":405,"title":"French Pegase 24 commander visits AFP","slug":"french-pegase-24-commander-visits-afp","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—Brigadier General Guillaume Thomas of the French Air Force made a courtesy visit to the AFP General Headquarters here on July 29, where he was welcomed and met by Lieutenant General Charlton Sean Gaerlan, Deputy Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP).</span></span>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2024/July%202024/peg.jpg","image_caption":"Lieutenant General Charlton Sean Gaerlan, Deputy Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), presents a memorabilia to Brigadier General Guillaume Thomas of the French Air Force during the latter's courtesy visit to the AFP General Headquarters in Quezon City on July 29.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2024-07-29T09:33:15+08:00","hits":278}]}